<view class="wrap">
  <view wx:if="{{requiresUpdate}}" class="notice notice-bad">
    这批数据的结构比当前小程序新，天赋可能显示不全。请更新「无限资料」后再看。
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{offline}}" class="notice">
    现在没连上线，天赋树要联网取。
  </view>

  <view class="head plate">
    <icon-cell src="{{iconUrl}}" size="md" label="{{nameCn}}" />
    <view class="head-main">
      <view class="head-name">{{nameCn}}</view>
      <view class="muted head-en">{{nameEn}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{!loaded}}" class="card muted">正在取这个职业…</view>

  <block wx:if="{{loaded}}">
    <!-- 可选种族：联盟 / 部落左右两框，框体吃阵营色（色相与网页同一组），
         框内一格＝图标在上、名字在下，一行三个往下排；框里不再写"联盟/部落" -->
    <view class="sec">
      <view class="sec-t">可以练这个职业的种族</view>
      <view wx:if="{{raceEmpty}}" class="card empty muted">{{raceEmpty}}</view>
      <view wx:else class="fac2">
        <view class="fac fac-alliance">
          <view class="fcell" wx:for="{{allianceRaces}}" wx:key="id">
            <icon-cell src="{{item.iconUrl}}" size="sm" label="{{item.nameCn}}" />
            <view class="fname">{{item.nameCn}}</view>
          </view>
          <view class="fcell fcell-empty" wx:for="{{padAlliance}}" wx:key="*this"></view>
        </view>
        <view class="fac fac-horde">
          <view class="fcell" wx:for="{{hordeRaces}}" wx:key="id">
            <icon-cell src="{{item.iconUrl}}" size="sm" label="{{item.nameCn}}" />
            <view class="fname">{{item.nameCn}}</view>
          </view>
          <view class="fcell fcell-empty" wx:for="{{padHorde}}" wx:key="*this"></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="sec">
      <view class="sec-t">技能书</view>
      <view class="btn gold" bindtap="onSpells">看{{nameCn}}的法术书 →</view>
    </view>

    <view class="sec">
      <view class="sec-t">天赋模拟器</view>
      <view wx:if="{{!talentLoaded}}" class="card muted">正在取天赋树…</view>
      <view wx:elif="{{!trees.length}}" class="card empty">
        <view>这个职业的天赋树还没有整理好。</view>
        <view class="muted">核到位之前这里不摆猜出来的树。</view>
      </view>
      <block wx:else>
        <!-- 读数条：剩余点数 + 三系各投了多少 + 分享 + 清空（"复制这套"按 2026-10-22 指令撤了） -->
        <view class="tbar plate">
          <view class="tbar-left">
            <text class="tnum">{{remaining}}</text><text class="tunit">/ {{totalPoints}} 点可用</text>
          </view>
          <view class="tbar-right">
            <button class="btn btn-share" open-type="share">分享这套</button>
            <view class="btn" bindtap="onReset">清空</view>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="muted tsum">{{spentText || '还没加点'}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{fromShare}}" class="muted tsum">这是别人分享给你的一套点法，改动它就变成你自己的</view>

        <view class="tabs">
          <view class="tab {{treeTab === index ? 'tab-on' : ''}}" wx:for="{{trees}}" wx:key="name"
                data-i="{{index}}" bindtap="onTreeTab">
            {{item.name}}<text class="tab-n">{{item.spent}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>

        <!-- 系底图：与网页同一张（art.json 的 specs/{职业}-{系序号}），上面压暗渐变，取不到留纯色 -->
        <view class="tree">
          <image wx:if="{{trees[treeTab].art}}" class="tree-art" src="{{trees[treeTab].art}}" mode="aspectFill" />
          <view wx:if="{{trees[treeTab].art}}" class="tree-scrim"></view>
          <view class="trow" wx:for="{{trees[treeTab].rows}}" wx:key="tier">
            <view class="tcell {{cell.ranks ? 'tcell-on' : ''}} {{cell.full ? 'tcell-full' : ''}} {{cell.can ? '' : 'tcell-off'}} {{cell.missing ? 'tcell-miss' : ''}}"
                  wx:for="{{item.cells}}" wx:for-item="cell" wx:key="id" data-id="{{cell.id}}"
                  bindtap="onTapNode" bindlongpress="onLongNode">
              <view class="tkick">
                <icon-cell src="{{cell.iconUrl}}" size="md" label="{{cell.name}}" />
                <text class="trank">{{cell.ranks}}{{cell.max ? '/' + cell.max : ''}}</text>
              </view>
              <view class="tname">{{cell.name || '名字待核'}}</view>
            </view>
            <view class="tcell tcell-empty" wx:for="{{4 - item.cells.length}}" wx:key="*this"></view>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="muted tree-note">点一下加一点，长按看详情。{{gateNote}}。名字与坐标来自第三方资料站转述，缺的写待核，不机翻。</view>
      </block>
    </view>
  </block>

  <!-- 天赋详情面板：能交代的事实都给（系、层、已点/上限、前置、相对经典旧世改没改、两个叫法），
       库里没有的那句"具体说明"照实说没有，不编。 -->
  <view wx:if="{{pop}}" class="mask" bindtap="popClose"></view>
  <view wx:if="{{pop}}" class="pop plate">
    <view class="pop-head">
      <icon-cell src="{{pop.iconUrl}}" size="md" label="{{pop.name}}" />
      <view class="pop-title">
        <view class="pop-name">{{pop.name || '名字待核'}}</view>
        <view class="muted pop-sub">{{pop.treeName}} · 第 {{pop.tier + 1}} 层</view>
      </view>
      <view class="pop-x" bindtap="popClose">关闭</view>
    </view>
    <view class="pop-row">
      <text class="pop-k">已点</text>
      <text class="pop-v">{{pop.ranks}}{{pop.max ? ' / ' + pop.max : ' / 上限未核实'}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="pop-row" wx:if="{{pop.alt}}">
      <text class="pop-k">也叫</text>
      <text class="pop-v">{{pop.alt}}<text class="muted pop-alt-note">（两家资料站叫法不同，两个都留）</text></text>
    </view>
    <view class="pop-row" wx:if="{{pop.changeText}}">
      <text class="pop-k">与经典旧世比</text>
      <text class="pop-v">{{pop.changeText}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="pop-row" wx:if="{{pop.requires}}">
      <text class="pop-k">要先点</text>
      <text class="pop-v">{{pop.requires}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="pop-row" wx:if="{{pop.why}}">
      <text class="pop-k">现在不能点</text>
      <text class="pop-v pop-why">{{pop.why}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="pop-desc">
      <text class="pop-k">这条做什么</text>
      <text class="muted pop-desc-v">具体说明还没入库——两家上游只给了名称、层位、上限和前置，效果原文要等官方中文页或游戏内实测才上界面，本站不机翻也不替它编一句。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="pop-btns">
      <view class="btn {{pop.can ? '' : 'btn-dim'}}" bindtap="popAdd">加一点</view>
      <view class="btn {{pop.ranks ? '' : 'btn-dim'}}" bindtap="popRemove">减一点</view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted pop-note">这套是本站页面内的模拟配置，不进游戏、不代表官方加点方案。</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{errorText}}" class="notice notice-bad">{{errorText}}</view>
  <view class="foot">非官方粉丝资料站，与暴雪娱乐及网易无关。</view>
</view>
